<title>LATVIA: Latvia short-term bill yields up, long-term down.</title>
<headline>Latvia short-term bill yields up, long-term down.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on Latvian Treasury bills showed a mixed direction at auction with yields on the two shortest-term bills rising but falling on the two issues of longer maturity paper on Wednesday, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>Amounts are in millions of lats unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD    (LAST WEEK)   ISSUE   BID   SOLD</p>
<p> 28-day	 9.64	   9.57	 1.0    1.1    0.9</p>
<p> 91-day	10.40	  10.23	 1.40   1.59   1.39</p>
<p> Six-month   11.95	  12.02	 2.75   5.23   2.75</p>
<p> One-year    12.96	  13.04	 1.35   2.48   1.35</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
